data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Verify the developer's React greeting-colour interface against the orchestrator's `DESIGN.md`.\\n\\nThe orchestrator has pushed its HEAD to your clone at `refs/campaign/orchestrator`. That commit contains both `DESIGN.md` and the developer's application. Check it out with:\\n\\n```sh\\ngit checkout refs/campaign/orchestrator\\n```\\n\\nThen:\\n1. Read `DESIGN.md` so you know what the interface should be.\\n2. Run the documented build command (`npm run build`).\\n3. Run the documented serve command (`npm run dev`).\\n4. Check the served interface against `DESIGN.md`:\\n   - Confirm the Header title is \\\"Hello App\\\" and the Footer reads \\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\".\\n   - Confirm the greeting text is \\\"Hello, world!\\\", is large and bold, and is initially blue (`--color-info`).\\n   - Confirm there are four buttons labelled exactly Blue, Green, Amber, Red.\\n   - Confirm each button changes the greeting colour to the token named in DESIGN.md (`--color-info`, `--color-success`, `--color-warning`, `--color-error`).\\n   - Confirm the active-colour button uses the `primary` variant while the others use `secondary`.\\n   - Confirm the Card is centred both vertically and horizontally between the Header and Footer.\\n   - Confirm the application uses `@codesweep-ai/ui` components: look for `data-component` attributes naming `Header`, `Footer`, `Button`, `Card`, `Page`, and `AppShell` in the rendered page.\\n   - Confirm `package.json` lists `@codesweep-ai/ui` and does not list the optional peers (`mermaid`, `puppeteer`, `pixelmatch`, `pngjs`).\\n5. Report what you ran, what you observed, and how you measured it. If any requirement fails, say so plainly and give the evidence.\\n\\nDo not modify the application code; only verify and report.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/tmp/dispatch-qa.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_67","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959415,"id":"chatcmpl-30fb94580a41488291b06493313c4fff","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

